{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T16:53:51+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-28T16:53:51+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Beijer Alma AB (publ)","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","country":"Sweden","city":"Uppsala","website":"https://beijeralma.se","employees":3767,"summary":"Beijer Alma AB (publ), together with its subsidiaries, engages in component manufacturing and industrial trading businesses in Sweden, rest of Nordic Region, rest of Europe, North America, Asia, and internationally. It operates in two segments, Beijer Components and Beijer Tech. The company offers industrial springs, and wire and flat strip components; replacement springs for cars and light trucks; industrial products comprising consumables, components, and machinery; and fluid technology products. It serves companies operating in automotive, engineering and infrastructure. The company was formerly known as Beijer Alma Industri & Handel and changed its name to Beijer Alma AB (publ) in 1998. The company was incorporated in 1983 and is headquartered in Uppsala, Sweden.","exchange":"Stockholm","currency":"SEK","financial_currency":"SEK","summary_fr":"Beijer Alma AB (publ), avec ses filiales, exerce des activités de fabrication de composants et de commerce industriel en Suède, dans le reste de la région nordique, dans le reste de l'Europe, en Amérique du Nord, en Asie et à l'international. Elle opère dans deux segments, Beijer Components et Beijer Tech. La société propose des ressorts industriels et des composants de fils et de bandes plates; des ressorts de remplacement pour voitures et camions légers; des produits industriels comprenant des consommables, des composants et des machines; et des produits de technologie des fluides.","summary_fr_excerpt":true},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":18379970560,"shares_outstanding":53885104,"trailing_pe":22.262774,"forwar